{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20792","headline":"感古四首 三 · 卢仝","name":"感古四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古来不患寡，所患患不均。\n单醪投长河，三军尽沈沦。\n今人异古人，结托唯亲宾。\n毁坼维鹊巢，不行鳲鸠仁。\n鄙恡不识分，有心占阳春。\n鸾鹤日已疎，燕雀日已亲。\n小物无大志，安测栖松筠。\n恩眷多弃故，物情尚逐新。\n瓦砾暂拂拭，光掩连城珍。\n唇吻恣谈铄，黄金同灰尘。\n苏秦北游赵，张禄西入秦。\n既变嫂叔节，仍摈华阳君。\n万世金石交，一饷如浮云。\n骨肉且不顾，何况长羁贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}